over.png", "id": "1128100341509644", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003242_1128100344842977_4351798447161286616_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9NIotilv5QAQ7kNvwG-VlVj&_nc_oc=Adl-D_cjsvz7tvqmjeSMx0D-5TqYuEBHMOIUdHqgaUQzlNbBGcEC2RYg2WUKMzMXs1U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuqHmUj8Aw2DRcfLcUvbhKoVrCpUzp5WQZIRmHx1nsxTQ&oe=69A43092"}, "display_name": "NHSBT Blood Identification VR AL", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The NHSBT blood identification app is designed to show learners the processes of correct blood group identification, as well as the consequences of administering a transfusion following incorrect blood group identification, emphasizing the relationship between blood group identification processes and patient wellbeing.\n\nNHSBT, the National Health Service Blood and Transplant in the UK, are a key authority in the country\u2019s healthcare system, responsible for blood donation and organ transplantation services. NHSBT needed a consistently repeatable learning experience that enabled learners to practise procedures without having to use lab resources, in a risk free environment and in their own time.\n\nThis learning experience is intended to be used as a training tool primarily for recently qualified doctors, scientists or college students interested in science.", "short_description": "The NHSBT blood identification app is designed to show learners the processes of correct blood group identification, as well as the consequences of administering a transfusion following incorrect blood group identification, emphasizing the relationship between blood group identification processes and patient wellbeing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://makereal.co.uk/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Make Real Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://makereal.co.uk/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": 